					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bitsin",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Master Trainer, Masters of the Night-Wind"
				},
				{
					"id": 751200104,
					"content": "That's why this Warrior's Challenge was set up. No matter how high up you are, you've got to watch your step... Would you like to give this a go, Outlander Warrior?",
